{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2022-05-26 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS THIRD QUARTER AND YEAR-TO-DATE OPERATING RESULTS FOR FISCAL 2022', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., MAY 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER (TWELVE WEEKS) AND THE FIRST 36 WEEKS OF FISCAL 2022, ENDED MAY 8, 2022.'}